{"id": "13-1385-2-6", "zh": "在 ssaṃ 等格尾之前，“gha”变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1385-7-19", "zh": "如 tassaṃ、tassā、tassāya、taṃ、sabhatiṃ。为什么说“在这些格尾之前”？", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1385-20-23", "zh": "如 tāya、sabhāya。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1386-2-7", "zh": "64. 在单数格尾和 yo 之前，非“gha”、非 o 的词变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1387-2-12", "zh": "在单数格尾和 yo 之前，三性中除去以“gha”和 o 结尾的名词，都变为短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1387-13-39", "zh": "如 itthiṃ、itthiyā、itthiyo，vadhuṃ、vadhuyā、vadhuyo，daṇḍiṃ、daṇḍinā、daṇḍino，sayambhuṃ、sayambhunā、sayambhuvo。为什么说“非‘gha’、非 o”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1387-40-45", "zh": "如 kaññāya、kaññāyo。提到 o，是为了用于下一条规则。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1388-2-7", "zh": "65. 在“ga”之前，可选。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1389-2-24", "zh": "三性中非“gha”、非 o 的词，在“ga”之前可选地变为短音，如 itthi、itthī，vadhu、vadhū，daṇḍi、daṇḍī，sayambhu、sayambhū。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1389-25-26", "zh": "为什么仍说“非‘gha’、非 o”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1389-27-32", "zh": "如 bhoti kaññā、bho go。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1390-2-7", "zh": "66. 在 si 之前，非中性词不变短音。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1391-2-8", "zh": "除中性以外的名词，在 si 之前不变为短音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1391-9-16", "zh": "如 itthī、daṇḍī、vadhū、sayambhū。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1391-17-19", "zh": "为什么说“在 si 之前”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1391-20-24", "zh": "如 itthiṃ。为什么说“非中性词”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1391-25-27", "zh": "如 daṇḍi kulaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1392-2-7", "zh": "67. 在“ga”、si、hi、naṃ 以外的格尾之前，go 变为 gāva、gava。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1393-2-33", "zh": "在除去“ga”、si、hi、naṃ 的格尾之前，go 这个词变为 gāva、gava。如（gāvaṃ、gavaṃ），gāvo、gavo，gāvena、gavena，gāvassa、gavassa，gāvasmā、gavasmā，gāve、gave。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1393-34-36", "zh": "为什么说“在‘ga’、si、hi、naṃ 以外”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1393-37-46", "zh": "如 bho go、go tiṭṭhati、gohi、gonaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1394-2-7", "zh": "68. 在 su 之前，可选。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1395-2-7", "zh": "go 在 su 之前可选地变为 gāva、gava。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1395-8-13", "zh": "如 gāvesu、gavesu、gosu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1396-2-7", "zh": "69. 连同 sa 变为 gavaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1397-2-10", "zh": "go 在 sa 之前，连同 sa 一起可选地变为 gavaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1397-11-16", "zh": "如 gavaṃ、gāvassa、gavassa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1398-2-8", "zh": "70. 连同 naṃ 也变为 gunnaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1399-2-9", "zh": "go 连同格尾 naṃ 一起可选地变为 gunnaṃ，也变为 gavaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1399-10-15", "zh": "如 gunnaṃ、gavaṃ、gonaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1400-2-6", "zh": "71. nā 变为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1401-2-7", "zh": "go 之后的 nā 可选地变为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1401-8-15", "zh": "如 gāvā、gavā、gāvena、gavena。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1402-2-6", "zh": "72. 在 aṃ 之前变为 gāvu。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "13-1403-2-7", "zh": "go 在格尾 aṃ 之前可选地变为 gāvha。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "13-1403-8-13", "zh": "如 vāvhaṃ、gāvaṃ、gavaṃ。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "13-1403-14-20", "zh": "没有为 go 规定 goṇa 这个替代形，因为 goṇa 是另一个词。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1404-2-7", "zh": "73. 在“pa”的 ī 之后变为 yaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1405-2-7", "zh": "在称为“pa”的 ī 之后，格尾 aṃ 可选地变为 yaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1405-8-11", "zh": "如 itthiyaṃ、itthiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1405-12-14", "zh": "为什么说“在‘pa’的 ī 之后”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1405-15-18", "zh": "如 daṇḍiṃ、rattiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1406-2-7", "zh": "74. 在“jha”的 ī 之后变为 naṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1407-2-7", "zh": "在称为“jha”的 ī 之后，格尾 aṃ 可选地变为 naṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1407-8-11", "zh": "如 daṇḍinaṃ、daṇḍiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1407-12-18", "zh": "那么“buddhaṃ ādiccabandhunaṃ”（日种之亲佛陀）这一形式怎么解释？", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1407-19-20", "zh": "这是由于把规则拆分开来运用。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "13-1407-21-23", "zh": "为什么说“jha”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1407-24-25", "zh": "如 itthiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1407-26-28", "zh": "为什么说“ī”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1407-29-30", "zh": "如 aggiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1408-2-8", "zh": "75. 在阳性中，yo 变为 no、ne。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1409-2-10", "zh": "在阳性中，“jha”的 ī 之后，yo 依次可选地变为 no、ne。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1409-11-19", "zh": "如 daṇḍīno、daṇḍine、daṇḍī。为什么仍说“在‘jha’的 ī 之后”？", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1409-20-24", "zh": "如 itthiyo。为什么说“在阳性中”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1409-25-27", "zh": "如 daṇḍīni kulāni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1410-2-6", "zh": "76. 变为 no。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1411-2-8", "zh": "在阳性中，“jha”的 ī 之后，yo 可选地变为 no。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1411-9-17", "zh": "如 daṇḍino tiṭṭhanti（持杖者们站着）、daṇḍino passa（你看那些持杖者），或者用 daṇḍī。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "13-1412-2-7", "zh": "77. smiṃ 变为 ni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1413-2-14", "zh": "在“jha”的 ī 之后，格尾 smiṃ 可选地变为 ni，如 daṇḍini、daṇḍismiṃ。为什么仍说“在‘jha’的 ī 之后”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1413-15-16", "zh": "如 aggismiṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1414-2-6", "zh": "78. 在 ambu 等词之后。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1415-2-18", "zh": "在 ambu 等词之后，smiṃ 可选地变为 ni，如“phalaṃ patati ambuni”（果子落进水里），“pupphaṃ yathā paṃsuni ātape kataṃ”（就像放在烈日下尘土里的花）。为什么说“可选”？", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "13-1415-19-22", "zh": "如 ambumhi、paṃsumhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1416-2-6", "zh": "79. 在 kamma 等词之后。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1417-2-7", "zh": "在 kamma 等词之后，smiṃ 可选地变为 ni。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1417-8-10", "zh": "如 kammani、kamme。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1417-11-31", "zh": "这一组词是：kamma、camma、vesma、bhasma（asma）、brahma、atta、ātuma、ghamma、muddha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1417-32-34", "zh": "为什么说“在 kamma 等词之后”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1417-35-36", "zh": "如 buddhe。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1418-2-6", "zh": "80. nā 变为 ena。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "13-1419-2-7", "zh": "在 kamma 等词之后，格尾 nā 可选地变为 ena。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "13-1419-8-17", "zh": "如 kammena、kammanā、cammena、cammanā。为什么仍说“在 kamma 等词之后”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1419-18-19", "zh": "如 buddhena。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1420-2-8", "zh": "81. 在“jha”“la”之后，sa 变为 no。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "13-1421-2-8", "zh": "在“jha”“la”之后，格尾 sa 可选地变为 no。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "13-1421-9-20", "zh": "如 aggino、aggissa，daṇḍino、daṇḍissa，bhikkhuno、bhikkhussa，sayambhuno、sayambhussa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "13-1422-2-28", "zh": "那么“yo ca sisso mahāmune”（大牟尼的弟子）这一形式怎么解释？由于在 brahma 等词的规则中有“Ito kvaci sassa ṭānubandho”（在 i 之后，sa 有时变为带 ṭ 标记的形式）这一读法，所以 sa 变为带 ṭ 标记的 e。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "13-1423-2-7", "zh": "82. smā 变为 nā。", "confidence": 80}
